你使用哪种模式，**两个**输入节点都必须上传文件。)*\n\n1. **If using Single Image Mode:** You must still upload a **placeholder ZIP file** on the right.\n   *(即使使用单图模式，右侧也必须上传一个 ZIP 包作为占位。)*\n\n2. **If using ZIP Batch Mode:** You must still upload a **placeholder image** on the left.\n   *(反之，如果使用压缩包模式，左侧也必须随便上传一张图片作为占位。)*"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [299.114990234375, 329.8299865722656], "pos": [623.969970703125, 951.4808959960938], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 👇 Click below to register & claim 1000 Free RH Coins:\n\n### [🇨🇳 CN Server (.cn)](https://www.runninghub.cn/?inviteCode=rh-v1221)\n\n### [🌏 Global Server (.ai)](https://www.runninghub.ai/?inviteCode=rh-v1221)\n\n---\n\n## [🚀 Run this workflow online on RTX 4090](https://www.runninghub.ai/post/1996473449142951937/?inviteCode=rh-v1221)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [441.97064208984375, 291.1081848144531], "pos": [43.51885986328125, -9.196494102478027], "id": 47, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 📜 Usage Instructions (使用说明)\n\n### This workflow offers two operating modes:\n### (该工作流提供两种操作模式：)\n\n---\n\n## 1️⃣ Single Image Refinement (Default)\n## 1. 单张图片洗图模式（默认）\n\n- **Function (功能):**\n  Refines a single input image and generates multiple variations (Batch Generation).\n  *(对单张图片进行洗图，并批量生成多个变体版本——即“批量抽卡”。)*\n\n- **Loop Count Setting (循环次数设置):**\n  Represents the number of variations you want to generate.\n  *(代表你想要生成的图片数量 / 抽卡次数。)*\n\n---\n\n## 2️⃣ ZIP Batch Processing\n## 2. ZIP 压缩包批量处理模式\n\n- **Function (功能):**\n  Enable the **\"ZIP Switch\"** and upload a ZIP archive containing your images for batch refinement.\n  *(开启“压缩包开关”，上传图片压缩包，进行批量洗图。)*\n\n- **Loop Count Setting (循环次数设置):**\n  Must be set to match the **total number of images** in your uploaded ZIP file.\n  *(必须设置为你压缩包内图片的“总张数”。)*\n\n---\n\n## ✨ New Feature (新增功能)\n**Automatically packs and saves all output results into a ZIP archive.**\n*(自动将所有出图结果打包并保存为 ZIP 压缩包。)*"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [562.3734130859375, 297.3243103027344], "pos": [527.6607666015625, -12.617074966430664], "id": 45, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 该工作流两个模式\n# 默认是单张图片洗图批量抽卡，此时的循环次数是：批量抽卡次数\n# 另一个模式，开启压缩包开关，上传图片压缩包，此时的循环次数是你压缩包有多少张图片，批量洗图。\n# 增加了打包出图结果保存为压缩包"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [562.3734130859375, 297.3243103027344], "pos": [1124.940185546875, -10.895021438598633], "id": 48, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "zip_filename", "label": "zip_filename", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "zip_filename"}], "size": [287.109375, 106], "pos": [570.9307250976562, 430.3420715332031], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI", "PNG", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "images or video_path", "link": 52, "label": "images or video_path", "type": "*", "localized_name": "images or video_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_format"}, "name": "image_format", "label": "image_format", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image_format"}, {"widget": {"name": "password"}, "shape": 7, "name": "password", "label": "password", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "password"}], "flags": {}, "id": 43, "type": "CompressImages", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CompressImages"}, "order": 37}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}, {"name"